    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties are delighted to present to the market approximately 1.6 acres of land in Rathcoursey, offering a rare opportunity to acquire an attractive parcel in a peaceful yet highly accessible East Cork location. Enjoying a private countryside setting, the site combines rural tranquillity with excellent connectivity to surrounding towns and amenities.\r\nA key advantage of this holding is that ESB connection and water supply are already in place, enhancing convenience and offering purchasers a strong foundation for future potential. Framed by mature natural boundaries and enjoying sea views, the property offers both privacy and an exceptional sense of space.\r\nIdeally positioned just minutes from Midleton, Castlemartyr, and Cloyne, the location provides easy access to an excellent range of amenities including schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, sports clubs and everyday services. The renowned East Cork coastline, including Ballycotton and Garryvoe, is also within easy reach, offering beaches, cliff walks and a sought-after coastal lifestyle. Cork City and the Jack Lynch Tunnel are conveniently accessible for commuters.\r\nFolio Numbers: CK174814F & CK188114F\r\nFor sale not subject to planning permission.\r\nPhotography for illustration purposes only.\r\n\r\n\r\nGUIDE PRICE: €90,000"
      },
